        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://rockwellnc.gov/town-history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Historic Rockwell Museum, housed in the former post office, preserves the town’s story with photographs, documents, and artifacts.",
